        <mxCell id="c71" value="&lt;b&gt;Self-reference.&lt;/b&gt; ParentAccountID points to another row in the same table. The highlighted ParentAccountID (11) is the AccountID of Fixed Assets, so Furniture and Fixtures sits under Fixed Assets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;AccountSubType marks summary accounts as Header, and no entries post to them. Current assets are identified by their subtype, not by a parent account." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="294" width="500" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
